    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Overview\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/24221ed2d8f797d31e5716f1fd2a5e53.avif?t=1754662862\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced RPG. The protagonist, Julie, has had her soul transformed into a Futanari monster by the demon goddess Lia. To thwart the plans of the goddess Liss\u2014and to satisfy her own desires\u2014Julie sets off on an adventure in a world filled with many beautiful and charming women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Devouring</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from essential story battles and elite enemies, players don\u2019t need to engage in traditional combat. Weaker monsters are instantly devoured upon collision, allowing Julie to grow stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.poster.avif?t=1754662862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.webm?t=1754662862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.mp4?t=1754662862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite Enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating tough enemies rewards special items that make it even easier for Julie to dominate the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/77e0cdb28d3901ef5e5250f24863b20d.avif?t=1754662862\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.poster.avif?t=1754662862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.webm?t=1754662862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.mp4?t=1754662862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A convenient CG collection guide feature lets you view the location of each undiscovered CG, and successfully collecting them can even boost your stats or level up your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/83e860072afc5a7734fbe1f6c4264bd2.avif?t=1754662862\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Female Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No journey to becoming a mighty Demon Lord would be complete without encountering women of all personalities including monster girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/